{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:00.00](\n[00:00.52]DY Krazy\n[00:01.28])\n[00:03.32]Yeah (This shit finna be hard, nigga)\n[00:05.00]Yeah (Millz what you on nigga? Uh-huh)\n[00:10.16]Yeah, Abyss, woo (Yeah, yeah)\n[00:12.88]Yeah, woah, woah, woah, huh\n[Chorus]\n[00:14.12]I'm like O. J. (Uh-huh), with the gloves (Uh-huh)\n[00:17.82]I'm like twenties, (Uh-huh), with the dubs (Uh-huh)\n[00:21.22]I'm her doctor, huh (Uh-huh), got her drugs (Uh-huh)\n[00:24.40]From the ghetto (Uh-huh), yeah, the slums (Uh-huh)\n[00:27.72]Big ol' AKs (Grrah), sound like a drum (Uh-huh)\n[00:31.04]Hit her from the back, she screamin' loud, speakin' in tongues (Yeah, yeah)\n[00:33.78]Cha-ching, I get paid-aid, yeah, rich as fuck\n[00:36.82]Hell yeah, she gon' fuck 'cause I got big bills, Donald Duck (Yeah)\n[Verse]\n[00:40.36]Chill, come here, what's your sign? Wait, don't tell me, bae\n[00:43.26]I'm a fortune-teller, read your mind\n[00:45.44]Stevie Wonder love, steal your heart, bitch, I will rob you blind\n[00:48.70]And Kurt Cobain, drugs, I been high since 1995\n[00:50.92]And I was born in '98 (I was born in '98, woo), ya dig?\n[00:53.46]That mean I been gettin' high since negative three, nigga, yeah (Ya dig?)\n[01:00.46]That mean I been gettin' high since negative three, nigga (Ya' dig?)\n[01:03.36]Saw three niggas, shot three times, now it's negative three niggas (Grrah, grrah, grrah)\n[01:07.46]Huh, huh, huh, do the math\n[01:09.30]High as hell, on Rodeo, spendin' cash, yeah\n[01:12.56]Drivin' crazy in a Mercedes, tryna scare Dash\n[01:16.16]Y'all don't even know who that is (Y'all don't even know)\n[01:20.10]Uh, yeah, on the money hunt, yeah\n[01:21.56]In the 'Rari listening to \"Bonjour\", yeah\n[01:23.54]Swervo tape, yeah, in the winter, I'll have every Moncler\n[01:26.78]From every season, you wanna know the reason? (Yeah)\n[01:29.76]I couldn't afford it back then, now I need everything, times ten (Uh)\n[01:33.74]Big ballin', Shaquille O'Neal, I'ma break the glass then (Uh)\n[01:37.04]Bad bitch wanna fuck, take a Perc', I'ma break her back in (Uh)\n[01:40.60]Uh, uh-uh-uh (Yeah, yeah), I'ma hit that shit all night long (What, what, what, what?)\n[Chorus]\n[01:47.20]I'm like O. J. (Uh-huh), with the glove (Uh-huh)\n[01:50.34]I'm like twenties (Uh-huh), with the dubs (Uh-huh)\n[01:53.90]I'm her doctor, huh (Yeah), got her drugs (Yeah, yeah)\n[01:57.10]From the ghetto (Yeah), yeah, the slums (Yeah, yeah)\n[02:00.42]Big ol' AK (Grra), sound like a drum (Yeah, yeah)\n[02:03.38]Hit her from the back, she screamin' loud, speakin' in tongues (Speakin' in tongues)\n[02:06.48]Cha-ching, I get paid-aid, yeah, rich as fuck\n[02:09.50]Hell yeah, she gon' fuck 'cause I got big bills, Donald Duck\n[Outro]\n[02:13.72]Uh, uh\n[02:15.32]Yeah, yeah, yeah\n[02:17.18]Uh, 808 the gang, hold up\n[02:20.48]150 the gang, No Limit the gang\n[02:23.60]You know what I claim-aim","words":[[0.0,0.22,"("],[0.52,0.56,"DY"],[0.94,1.26,"Krazy"],[1.28,2.64,")"],[3.32,3.48,"Yeah"],[3.52,3.7,"(This"],[3.78,3.9,"shit"],[3.96,4.14,"finna"],[4.18,4.22,"be"],[4.28,4.6,"hard,"],[4.72,4.9,"nigga)"],[5.0,5.54,"Yeah"],[6.3,6.6,"(Millz"],[6.68,6.82,"what"],[6.86,7.04,"you"],[7.1,7.12,"on"],[7.44,9.86,"nigga?"],[9.9,10.1,"Uh-huh)"],[10.16,10.22,"Yeah,"],[10.26,11.18,"Abyss,"],[11.22,11.3,"woo"],[11.34,11.48,"(Yeah,"],[12.06,12.84,"yeah)"],[12.88,12.98,"Yeah,"],[13.26,13.4,"woah,"],[13.44,13.52,"woah,"],[13.64,13.82,"woah,"],[13.9,14.08,"huh"],[14.12,14.58,"I'm"],[14.64,14.82,"like"],[14.98,14.98,"O."],[15.28,15.28,"J."],[15.4,16.12,"(Uh-huh),"],[16.16,16.28,"with"],[16.32,16.38,"the"],[16.5,17.06,"gloves"],[17.1,17.78,"(Uh-huh)"],[17.82,17.88,"I'm"],[17.94,18.1,"like"],[18.16,18.62,"twenties,"],[18.72,18.96,"(Uh-huh),"],[19.46,19.6,"with"],[19.76,19.8,"the"],[19.86,20.62,"dubs"],[21.08,21.18,"(Uh-huh)"],[21.22,21.26,"I'm"],[21.32,21.44,"her"],[21.52,22.1,"doctor,"],[22.32,22.36,"huh"],[22.4,22.72,"(Uh-huh),"],[22.76,22.86,"got"],[22.96,23.0,"her"],[23.14,23.94,"drugs"],[23.98,24.36,"(Uh-huh)"],